_:nf5329b72cee5422083022753c7eeee6axb0	http://schema.org/description	"The first work by Spanish director Alex de la Iglesia, &#39;Acción mutante&#39; is a story set on a dystopian future, the year 2012. Fear and chaos have taken over the city of Bilbao, where a strange terrorist group, known as &quot;Acción Mutante&quot;, are planning to take revenge on the rich and handsome. The armed group is formed by deformed beings, lead by Ramón (Antonio Resines), one of this evil and heartless beings. &quot;Acción Mutante&quot; is planning an attack against society, by taking the daughter of a powerful industrialist hostage, a plan that they will carry out during a wedding. The cast is formed by actors and actresses like: Álex Angulo, Frédérique Feder, Juan Viadas, Karra Elejalde, Saturnino García y Fernando Guillén."
