_:n6f98f859712a4d79bd326461eb816491xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Sebastian embarks on a journey of survival through the deserted streets of Barcelona while a mysterious presence is destroying the world&#39;s population. During the adventure, Sebastian will meet new survivors with whom he will forcibly group together to try to flee the city. However, the dangers they had known will remain in the background after having met an even more dangerous threat. Produced by the original producers of &#39;Bird Box&#39;, this Spanish version is directed by David and Alex Pastor. The casting is comprised of both a national and international cast and this film will be defined by the talents of Mario Casas, Georgina Campbell, Alejandra Howard, Nalia Schuberth, Patrick Criado, Diego Calva, Gonzalo de Castro, Lola Dueñas, Leonardo Sbaraglia and Michelle Jenner among others. This spin off of &#39;Bird Box&#39; starring Sandra Bullock now seeks to delve through that world full of mystery that was presented to us in 2018. This film was groundbreaking in terms of its subject matter and now, Spain seeks to achieve the same effect in one of the most iconic Spanish cities, Barcelona. This movie will premiere exclusively on Netflix worldwide, giving David Pastor and Álex Pastor the opportunity to everybody of enjoying this sequel."
