_:n311840627f2844039e093aa93d22d6b3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Alice and Céline are neighbors and very close friends. They both enjoy a pleasant life, happy families and two sons who are growing up together. Everything gets complicated when Maxima, the son of Céline, dies when he falls down out a window under Alice eyes. Céline can&#39;t get over his son death and blame her friend about the fatal accident, which will make both friends distance from each other and create a tension between the two families. The situation gets even worse when Alice starts suspecting Céline wants revenge by using her son Théo, which will drown her into a situation where imagination and reality, the good and the bad, are al mixed up. A thriller that takes as to older times and reminds to Hitchcock&#39;s films."
