_:n9dc68fca66c9447e82846995072f7691xb0	http://schema.org/description	"&#39;My fault&#39; is an Amazon Prime Video original film based on the novels of the successful trilogy &#39;Culpables&#39; by Mercedes Ron (&#39;My fault&#39;, &#39;Your fault&#39;, &#39;Our fault&#39;), which has more than 50 million views on Wattpad and almost one million copies sold worldwide. The film tells the story of Noah, a girl who must leave her city, her boyfriend and her friends to move into the mansion of William Leister, the new and wealthy husband of her mother, Rafaella. At only 17 years old, with a proud and independent character, Noah resists living in that ostentatious mansion surrounded by luxuries. There she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, with whom she clashes from the first moment due to their very different personalities. It doesn&#39;t take long for Noah to discover that, behind his image as a model son, Nick hides a secret life of fighting, gambling and illegal car racing that to Noah represents everything he has always run from. However, their differences and tensions will inevitably lead to an irresistible attraction that will soon turn into pure fire and unbridled passion. Neither the continuous rivalry between the two, nor the opposition of their environment will be able to prevent them from ending up lost and secretly in love. But Nick&#39;s troubled present, coupled with Noah&#39;s troubled past, will test both their lives and their forbidden love. &#39;My fault&#39; stars Nicole Wallace (&#39;Skam Spain&#39;, &#39;Parot&#39;) and Gabriel Guevara (&#39;Hit&#39;), with Marta Hazas, Iván Sánchez, Eva Ruiz and Victor Varona. The film is produced by Pokeepsie Films (&#39;Veneciafrenia&#39;, &#39;30 monedas&#39;, &#39;El bar&#39;) with Álex de la Iglesia and Carolina Bang as producers and Domingo González as director and screenwriter."
