_:n66cefa7f24124c9db6a15436951abf71xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Third feature film based on &#39;My Hero Academia&#39; manga series, created by Kôhei Horikoshi. Directed by Kenji Nagasaki and written by Yôsuke Kuroda, &#39;World Heroes&#39; Mission&#39; shows how a terrorist organization called Humarise, led by the cruel and fearsome Flect Turn, believe that Quirk Dommsday Theory is near, as humans with superpowers will they are becoming the dominant gene versus those who do not have them. For this reason, they have orchestrated attacks around the world to exterminate all those people who possess superpowers, the equivalent of 80% of the world&#39;s population. To avoid a worldwide massacre, the World Organization of Heroes decides that student superheroes from all over the world go to the different headquarters that Humarise has throughout the World. Midoriya, Bakugo, and Todoroki are sent to Otheon, a small country in central Europe where Humarise&#39;s headquarters are supposed to be. The three witness a robbery and seek to find the thieves, thus crossing paths with Rody Soul, a teenager who accepts small-time jobs to feed his siblings. A series of misfortunes will cause Midoriya and Rody to be forced to work together when they pick up the wrong briefcase, where instead of the jewels of the heist are the codes to prevent Humarise from causing a worldwide slaughter. Deku and Rody will become fugitives from justice in a race against time in which they seek to confront Flec Turn and thus dismantle the dangerous terrorist organization. A path in which they will have to be allies and trust each other, which will not be easy at all."
