_:nd09a82f428ef43de9726e296b58201f9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Actors Scott Adkins (&#39;John Wick 4&#39;, &#39;Castle Falls&#39;, &#39;Legacy of Lies&#39;, &#39;Accident Man 2&#39;), Ashley Greene (&#39;Twilight&#39;, &#39;The Twilight Saga: New Moon&#39;, &#39;The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 1&#39;, &#39;The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 2&#39;, &#39;The Twilight Saga: Eclipse&#39;, &#39;The Wrong Place&#39;, &#39;A Little Christmas Charm&#39;) and Ryan Phillippe (&#39;Lady of the Manor&#39;, &#39;The Innocent&#39;, &#39;Revenge for Jolly!&#39;) headline the cast of &#39;One Shot&#39;, a frenetic film set on a secret CIA base. Packed with adrenaline, action and situations on the brink, the film is directed and co-written by filmmaker James Nunn (&#39;The Marine 6: Close Quarters&#39;, &#39;Extreme Chase 5&#39;, &#39;Eliminators&#39;, &#39;Green Street 3: Never Back Down&#39;, &#39;Francotirador &#39; &#39;Les Touristes&#39;, &#39;PokerStars: Natural Born Poker Player&#39;). Alongside him is the screenplay by Jamie Russell. Emmanuel Imani, Dino Kelly, Waleed Elgadi, Terence Maynard, Jess Liaudin, Lee Charles complete the cast of the feature. The plot of &#39;One Shot&#39; focuses on the covert mission to be carried out by members of an elite Navy SEAL squad that consists of transporting a major terrorist suspect from a secret CIA prison. The problem comes when they get trapped because a group of insurgents try to attack them trying to rescue the same prisoner."
