_:na6562cb779874bafa4294c2be23a1ff2xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Juanjo, Sebas and Rayco, due to their hair problems, have self-esteem problems. Rayco is a reggaeton singer and his alopecia could give him his concerts. Juanjo is a 40-year-old man who looked with dignity on the pavement of his head until he fell in love with Inma, a woman obsessed with aesthetic adjustments and who thinks that being married to a bald man ruins his image. Finally, Sebas prefers to hide his baldness with a natural hair wig. With this capillary prosthesis he intends to compete with the &quot;fur&quot; of his ex-wife&#39;s new boyfriend, apparently a perfect man whose daughters are starting to call &quot;dad&quot;. With all these setbacks the three men decide to undertake a trip to Turkey with the intention of implanting hair, but that is when they will realize that it does not matter so much the exterior image as the interior of each. The main cast includes Spanish actors Carlos Librado, Antonio Pagudo, Tomy Aguilera, Amaia Salamanca, Eva Ugarte, Alba Planas, María Hervás, Leo Harlem, Jesús Vidal, Laura Quirós, Iván Armesto and Mario Ermito. Nacho G. Velilla directs the film &#39;Por los Pelos&#39;. It is produced by Atresmedia, Buendía Estudios, Felicitas Media and Microinjerto Producciones A.I.E., with the participation of Atresmedia and Movistar+ and Crea SGR. Distribution will be handled by Warner Bros. Pictures Spain."
