_:n7af2ed0e43aa4590a62c0648b19dc3fcxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Starring Bradley Cooper, Jeremy Irons, Dennis Quaid, Olivia Wilde and Zoë Saldana, the layered romantic drama The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There&#39;s only one catch - he didn&#39;t write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man&#39;s work, and for placing ambition and success above life&#39;s most fundamental three words."
