_:n82ae76a8fee9462e8a54877b9e784463xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Oscar-winner filmmaker Rober Zemeckis, the author behind titles like &#39;Forrest Gump&#39; and &#39;Castaway&#39; directs Steve Carrel in &#39;Welcome to Marwen&#39;, film inspired in the documentary &#39;Marwencol&#39;, the emotional real story of Mark Hogancamp&#39;s struggle, a broken man who after being victim to a terrible assault and waking from a coma, discovered that imagination and art are truly able to heal the human mind. The script to the film is written by Caroline Thompson and Robert Zemeckis. Zemeckis is credited as a producer too, as well as Steve Starkey and Jack Rapke from ImageMovers, Zemeckis&#39; production company based in Universal. The executive producing is carried out by Jackie Levine and Jeff Malmberg, who in the year 2010 directed the extraordinary documentary that works as inspiration form the film"
