_:n393cd51c634f481392ec188e6d61aaf3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"&#39;XXx: The Return of Xander Cage&#39; will give us back the spy and lover of extreme sports Xander Cage, a character that skipped the second installment of the saga &#39;xXx 2: State of emergency&#39;. Vin Diesel (&#39;Riddick&#39;, &#39;Fast & Furious 7&#39;) returns to this third part giving life again to that character full of adrenaline which, according to the actor himself, is so much fun to play. Diesel ensures that the script, written by John D. Brancato, Michael Ferris and Rich Wilkes, is packed with action with a storyline that mixes the espionage genre with those impossible sports. In this new installment Xander Cage is back in action on the skin of a secret agent of some sorts, with an emphasis on secrecy because the world still thinks he died in a terrible accident. Augustus Gibbons (Samuel L. Jackson) assigned him a new mission in a film in which will also star Nina Dobrev, Ruby Rose and Toni Collette. DJ. Caruso (&#39;Eagle Eye&#39;, &#39;I Am Number Four&#39;) joins the new team of &#39;xXx&#39; as a director of a film that features Diesel also in production."
