_:nca289949124240818fb2dc9d3415c92fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Zeroville&#39; is the story of Vikar, a student, who is obsessed with cinema. One day he abandons his degree in theology in order to travel to Los Angeles. It&#39;s summer from 1969, when Charles Manson&#39;s &quot;family&quot; is murdering people from all around Hollywood. This young guy will travel at the same time to Hollywood, following his dream of becoming a filmmaker and attempting to fit in in a world of sex, drugs and music that he doesn&#39;t understand. &#39;Zeroville&#39; shows a dark portrait of the Hollywood from the 70s with humor. The movie is directed and starred by James Franco (&#39;The disaster artist&#39;, 127 hours&#39;). The script is written by Paul Felten y Ian Olds, and it is based on Steve Erockson&#39;s novel. The cast who accompanied Franco in the film have Megan Fox (&#39;Transformers&#39;, &#39;Jonah Hex&#39;), Seth Rogen (&#39;Neighbors 2: Sorority Rising&#39;, &#39;Pineapple Express&#39;), Joey King (&#39;The Conjuring&#39;, &#39;Life in Pieces&#39;), Jacki Weaver (&#39;Silver Linings Playbook&#39;, &#39;Animal Kingdom&#39;), Danny McBride (&#39;Up in the Air&#39;, &#39;Pineapple Express&#39;), Dave Franco (&#39;Now You See Me&#39;, &#39;Nerve&#39;) and Craig Robinson (&#39;Hot Tub Time Machine&#39;, &#39;I am Dolemite&#39;). The movie also have cameo of other movies star such as Will Ferrell (&#39;Anchorman: The Legend of Ron Burgundy&#39;, &#39;The Lego Movie&#39;), or Gus Van Sant (&#39;Good Will Hunting&#39;)."
